---

Note on the bundled AI models, which are NOT covered by the above:

  * face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx
  * face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx

Both come from the OpenCV Model Zoo (https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo) and
are licensed Apache-2.0, Copyright the OpenCV project contributors. They are
not stored in this repository; `faceid models --download` fetches them from
the upstream GitHub release with a sha256 check.

A face image is biometric data. This repository deliberately ignores every
image file and every enrolment store so that a test fixture or a gallery can
never be committed by accident. Do not add them.
